  "conclusions": [
    "Prior missing-source-location finding closed: diagnostics retain original completion/assignment/unit/room/item IDs and readable location even when calculable facts are empty; current source navigation independently proves same-project identity, visibility and quantity capability, otherwise explains unavailability.",
    "Prior aggregated-row-return finding closed: each link resolves its own unit/stage/completion, and return focus selects that completion floor and anchor.",
    "First A draft and quantity entry use authorized A preview project candidates rather than historical payroll rows; stable draftKey and source-return context are preserved; no draft record is created by preview.",
    "Blank or cleared project/leader/month values are accepted only by partial read-preview validation, returning explicit blockers and disabled saving; full command validation still requires valid identities and month.",
    "Reviewed calculation, price revision, prior actual-payment fingerprint, unknown-command recovery and frozen document boundaries remain consistent with P1 scope."
  ],
